 owner-bound NomadDrone uses the exact baseline SentryDroneLaser against the captain's current target and is deleted with its owner; the captain retains its strict-below-half ranked shield."},{"name":"Undermind","noun":"NomadScope","slug":"nomadscope-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":30,"base_hit_points":80,"estimated_hit_points":549.6,"estimated_damage_min":10.7,"estimated_damage_max":21.4,"descriptions":["Ignites heroes, increases their Energy vulnerability, and gives allies a fiery buff."],"behavior":"Its fiery strike applies burning and stacking Energy vulnerability and projects the allied Energy-damage buff."},{"name":"Acid Shell","noun":"NomadSpecialThree","slug":"nomadspecialthree-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":30,"base_hit_points":100,"estimated_hit_points":687,"descriptions":["Spits acid at the heroes while strafing between attacks.","Highly resistant to energy damage while mobile.","At half health, withdraws into its shell, becoming immune to physical damage and emitting area effect poison."],"behavior":"Its acid projectile, rank-shaped Energy Defense, bounded post-shot strafe-or-idle movement, half-health Physical-immunity Turtle phase, and ranked poison pulses are active."},{"name":"Mending Tanglid","noun":"VerdanthSpecialTwo","slug":"verdanthspecialtwo-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":30,"base_hit_points":80,"estimated_hit_points":549.6,"estimated_damage_min":32.2,"estimated_damage_max":64.3,"descriptions":["Heals badly hurt allies; roots heroes, calls nearby friends to attack them, and keeps away from heroes."],"behavior":"Its strict-below-half support branch heals first, its repeated close-range retreat keeps separation, and Entangle applies the ranked root and redirects all living allies inside 20 units to that victim."},{"name":"Warp Spawner","noun":"ZelemSpecialOne","slug":"zelemspecialone-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":30,"base_hit_points":110,"estimated_hit_points":755.7,"descriptions":["Being shifted halfway into an alternate dimension makes them highly resistant to area effect attacks.","Launches time-space warping projectiles that will randomly teleport heroes who are hit by them."],"behavior":"Incoming area damage is reduced by 75 percent and a successful projectile hit performs the recovered random reachable-position teleport."},{"name":"Arachno Striker","noun":"NocturnaSpecialHomer","slug":"nocturnaspecialhomer-noun","role":"Lieutenant","challenge_value":30,"base_hit_points":90,"estimated_hit_points":618.3,"estimated_damage_min":10.7,"estimated_damage_max":32.2,"descriptions":["Slow homing projectiles terrify heroes, then it chases terrified victims into melee."],"behavior":"The projectile applies Fear and the phase selects close melee against the affected target."}]}}
